# .dockerignore — outline only, no implementation yet.
#
# Same idea as .gitignore, but for what NOT to send into the Docker
# build context (everything in this folder gets sent to the Docker
# daemon when you build, unless excluded here — irrelevant files just
# slow the build down and bloat the image if accidentally copied in).
#
# Worth excluding: __pycache__/, *.pyc, a venv folder if you use one,
# .git (if it'd otherwise be included), and this repo's .env (never
# belongs inside the image).
